Moonset DSH theme
=================

The colour palette used by this plugin originates from the Moonset document site

    https://github.com/unmbt/moonset-document

by Wyatex (https://github.com/Wyatex), who generously allowed it to be reused
for this project ("拿去抄" — take it and copy it) in the MoonBit community chat.

This repository contains no source code from that site: the plugin re-derives the
palette as 228 --dsw-* tokens for the DeepSeek Harness theme system and adds its
own skin layer. Colour design credit belongs to the original author.
